<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 122 0 R
/E (Paper trading is a practice activity that helps students learn trading without using real money. I used TradingView Paper Trading to practise buying and selling cryptocurrencies. During this programme, I traded Bitcoin \(BTCUSD\) and Ethereum \(ETHUSD\) using LONG and SHORT positions. I also used SMA, RSI 14, Support and Resistance, and price movements to make trading decisions. This report explains my trading performance, strategies, mistakes, and learning experience during the programme.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
